May 3, 2006 
<br><br>
Hales Sand and Gravel Elsinore<br>
Hales Sand & Gravel Inc.<br>
Elsinore, Sevier County, Utah<br>
Mine I.D. No. 42-00893

<br><br>
Investigators 
<br><br>
Daniel C. Stevenson <br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector 
<br><br>
